<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>FLY</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Quavo, Lenny Kravitz</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">FLY</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5CJ3DQPUmrtI2lqRjPk4K6</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.005" end="00:04.242">[Intro: Quavo]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.242" end="00:05.742">Go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.763" end="00:06.338">Woo, woo, woo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.338" end="00:07.838">Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.756" end="00:08.256" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.949" end="00:08.449">[Chorus: Quavo, Lenny Kravitz]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.109" end="00:09.493">I want to get away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.493" end="00:13.318">I wanna fly away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.318" end="00:16.298">Yeah, yeah, yeah (Fly away, fly away)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.298" end="00:18.259" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Go, go, go, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.259" end="00:21.203">I want to get away (Go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.203" end="00:24.936">I wanna fly away (Woo, woo, woo, woo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.936" end="00:29.560">Yeah, yeah, yeah (I wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.560" end="00:31.060">Quavo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.982" end="00:31.482" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.237" end="00:31.737">[Verse 1: Quavo, Lenny Kravitz]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.413" end="00:31.913">I'm feelin' the wave (Feelin' the wave)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.840" end="00:33.618">I wanna fly (I wanna fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.618" end="00:36.172">Let's get geeked, let's get drunk, let's get high (Let's get high)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.172" end="00:37.920">Don't go on a plane (Phew)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.920" end="00:39.420">I'm sittin' the jet way (Jet)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.359" end="00:42.289">You already know which way we goin' (Go), that way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.289" end="00:44.961">Told her I wanna get you paid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.961" end="00:48.140">Oh, you like that? Okay, bounce right back, go rage (Go rage)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.140" end="00:49.689">Oh, you like that? When I bite that? (Woo, woo, woo, woo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.689" end="00:51.189">Wanna fight back, okay (Okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.868" end="00:53.576">She turned and said, "Yeah" (Go, go, go, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.576" end="00:55.076" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.839" end="00:55.339">[Chorus: Quavo, Lenny Kravitz]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.335" end="00:57.946">I want to get away (Woo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.946" end="01:01.679">I wanna fly away (Wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.679" end="01:05.553">Yeah, yeah, yeah (Wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.553" end="01:07.053" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Go, go, go, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.673" end="01:09.469">I want to get away (Go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.469" end="01:13.613">I wanna fly away (Woo) (Wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.613" end="01:16.518">Yeah, yeah, yeah (I wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.518" end="01:18.018" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.937" end="01:18.944">[Verse 2: Quavo, Lenny Kravitz, &amp; Quavo with Lenny Kravitz]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.944" end="01:22.087">Butterfly doors on the lambo, I'm tryna spread my wings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.087" end="01:24.502">I got a bad lil' pretty Spanish, take from</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.502" end="01:27.460">I might fly away before she get a wedding ring (Fly away)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.460" end="01:30.412">But she wanna stay, she told me she'll never leave (Never leave)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.412" end="01:33.492">Put some feathers on my drip 'cause I'm fly (I'm fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.492" end="01:36.860">Diamonds twinkle every time I'm outside (That's on God)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.860" end="01:39.644">They almost brighter than the stars and the ice (Ice, ice, ice)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.644" end="01:41.144">She an angel like I took her from the sky (Go, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.493" end="01:41.993" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.872" end="01:42.524">[Chorus: Quavo &amp; Lenny Kravitz]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.524" end="01:45.665">I want to get away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.665" end="01:49.147">I wanna fly away (Wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.147" end="01:53.347">Yeah, yeah, yeah (Wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.347" end="01:54.847" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Go, go, go, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.815" end="01:57.316">I want to get away (Go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.316" end="02:01.527">I wanna fly away (Woo) (Wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.527" end="02:04.343">Yeah, yeah, yeah (I wanna fly, fly, fly, fly)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.343" end="02:05.843" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.210" end="02:06.710" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.647" end="02:07.147">[Outro: Quavo &amp; Lenny Kravitz]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.257" end="02:08.835">Fly away with that cash, fly away with that gas (You know)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.835" end="02:12.351">If I wouldn't get you grabbed, please don't make me mad (Yeah!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.351" end="02:15.157">Fly away when I smash, fly away with that ass (Smash)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.157" end="02:16.657">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.044" end="02:17.868">I want to get away (Let's roll)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.868" end="02:21.010">Flyest in the room, we're flyer than you (On God)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.010" end="02:24.028">Flyest in the room, you just passed the moon (I'm gone)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.028" end="02:27.327">Highest of the high, higher like the view (Uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.327" end="02:28.827">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.231" end="02:29.731">I want to get away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.143" end="02:33.143">Yeah (You feel me?)</p></div></body></tt>